{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03332",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.92,
      "end_seconds": 5.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Morning, um, doctor. Lovely to meet you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.78,
      "end_seconds": 12.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.82,
      "text": "alright, you're alright, take a seat what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.66,
      "end_seconds": 19.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "Doctor, it's double vision. It's getting on my nerves now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.86,
      "end_seconds": 24.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.35,
      "end_seconds": 31.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "It's, It's been two months, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.26,
      "end_seconds": 35.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "How strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.61,
      "end_seconds": 40.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "It feels severe to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.5,
      "end_seconds": 43.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 44.5,
      "end_seconds": 53.31,
      "duration_seconds": 8.81,
      "text": "Yeah, it usually comes with being sick. Um, the being sick? That's been for two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.96,
      "end_seconds": 71.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.79,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any weakness on one side, head injury or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.55,
      "end_seconds": 76.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "no, you know, none that I've noticed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.3,
      "end_seconds": 82.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.35,
      "end_seconds": 88.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "Right, um, no, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.85,
      "end_seconds": 91.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "So, has your skin been okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.33,
      "end_seconds": 93.31,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "no rashes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.12,
      "end_seconds": 96.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.64,
      "end_seconds": 102.87,
      "duration_seconds": 5.23,
      "text": "Yes, I had an operation for a hernia, last spring."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.17,
      "end_seconds": 112.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "A A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.91,
      "end_seconds": 130.0,
      "duration_seconds": 17.09,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life. I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours. I do a yoga class on Thursdays. I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.95,
      "end_seconds": 134.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Alright, do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.88,
      "end_seconds": 146.95,
      "duration_seconds": 10.07,
      "text": "Yeah, I have an underactive thyroid, for about ten years. Okay, so I've had an irregular heartbeat, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.53,
      "end_seconds": 159.88,
      "duration_seconds": 11.35,
      "text": "Right, so an underactive thyroid is already on your record. We'll keep that in mind today. Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.6,
      "end_seconds": 168.22,
      "duration_seconds": 7.62,
      "text": "Hmm, uh, I'm on bisoprolol, 2.5 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.18,
      "end_seconds": 171.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Let's start with the basic checks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.19,
      "end_seconds": 182.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.77,
      "end_seconds": 211.74,
      "duration_seconds": 7.97,
      "text": "Okay: pressure 161 over 89, temperature 36.8, respiratory rate 17, pulse is 81 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 212.52,
      "end_seconds": 214.22,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.64,
      "end_seconds": 219.5,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "They help me see the whole picture, more shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.36,
      "end_seconds": 226.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.34,
      "end_seconds": 235.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "yeah, no problem"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.46,
      "end_seconds": 238.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.87,
      "end_seconds": 259.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.73,
      "text": "The optic discs look swollen and you are drowsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.73,
      "end_seconds": 276.39,
      "duration_seconds": 11.66,
      "text": "that's all I needed to check okay, so my impression is this: This looks most like possible cerebral venous thrombosis. Raised pressure in the head is still possible"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 277.09,
      "end_seconds": 281.52,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "Mm, do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.21,
      "end_seconds": 291.67,
      "duration_seconds": 8.46,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like possible cerebral venous thrombosis, but I'd like to confirm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.82,
      "end_seconds": 309.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "I want an MRI of the head done, that's for papilloedema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 311.14,
      "end_seconds": 314.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "I can book that for Monday at 2 pm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.88,
      "end_seconds": 331.22,
      "duration_seconds": 15.34,
      "text": "Stop the pill, you need an urgent scan and admission. I'm going to send a referral to the neurology team. Come back straight away. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 333.17,
      "end_seconds": 336.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}